    "group": "Blitza‑bommer",
    "summary": "As the opponent’s [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, pick a **visible** enemy unit no farther than 24″ from the Blitza-bommer. Exclude units with **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)**. Roll a D6 for the chosen unit. Deal D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on 1–3, 3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on 4–5, or D3+3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on 6.",
